{%- comment -%}
  Editorial Press layout, hardcoded (same approach as
  pm-about-content.liquid) and shown automatically by main-page.liquid
  when page.handle == 'press' — no manual template assignment needed,
  no schema/blocks to configure. Reuses the same image+copy "spread"
  pattern as the About page (pm-about.css: .pm-about-spread /
  .pm-press-spread), alternating which side the image sits on per
  mention. Each mention's image is a placeholder until a real photo or
  screenshot of the coverage is swapped in — replace the
  pm-media-placeholder render with a real <picture>/<img> per mention
  the same way pm-about-content.liquid does it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'pm-homepage.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'pm-about.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

